{"id":68242,"date":"2025-02-16T17:33:53","date_gmt":"2025-02-16T16:33:53","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=68242"},"modified":"2026-09-27T23:49:07","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T22:49:07","slug":"corvus-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corvus-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Corvus Trail Branco Gaspar 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corvus Trail Branco Gaspar 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Corvus Trail Branco Gaspar 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>19 de Dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), com partida agendada a partir das <strong>09:30<\/strong> em Abran\u00e7alha de Baixo, na freguesia de S\u00e3o Vicente, concelho de <strong>Abrantes<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>. Esta conceituada competi\u00e7\u00e3o desportiva proporciona uma experi\u00eancia \u00fanica nos trilhos ribatejanos e florestais da regi\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa integra as provas competitivas de <strong>Trail Longo (31 km)<\/strong> e <strong>Trail Curto (18 km)<\/strong>, certificadas pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Santar\u00e9m (AAS) e integradas nos circuitos ITRA, UTMB World Series Qualifier e Circuito de Trail do Ribatejo (CTR), al\u00e9m do <strong>Mini Trail (10 km)<\/strong>, <strong>Caminhada (10 km)<\/strong> e <strong>Trail Kids (1 km)<\/strong>. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o garante postos de controlo e abastecimento regulares, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip, refor\u00e7o final tradicional com sopa e p\u00e3o com chouri\u00e7o, apoio m\u00e9dico e lembran\u00e7a de finalista.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A realiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo do <strong>COA &#8211; Clube de Orienta\u00e7\u00e3o e Aventura<\/strong>, em parceria institucional com o Munic\u00edpio de Abrantes e a Junta de Freguesia de S\u00e3o Vicente, assegurando um evento seguro, rigoroso e festivo para toda a comunidade desportiva.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snaps